    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Off-plans event now live – homes currently under construction are now available for sale on first release through DNG Duffy New Homes.\r\n\r\nSales are being conducted exclusively from our office at 66 Clanbrassil Street. Please get in touch with our team today to discuss availability.\r\n\r\nDNG Duffy proudly present Bellingham Manor, an exceptional new development nestled in the heart of the scenic and historic village of Castlebellingham. Offering a superb variety of 2, 3 and 4-bedroom homes, including detached, semi-detached, and terraced options, Bellingham Manor is designed to meet the needs of the modern homeowner, combining architectural elegance with everyday practicality.\r\n\r\nEach home in Bellingham Manor has been meticulously crafted to the highest standards, featuring spacious interiors, high-quality finishes, and superior energy efficiency. Whether you are a first-time buyer, a growing family looking to upgrade, or seeking a peaceful retreat, these homes offer a turnkey lifestyle where contemporary design meets total comfort.\r\n\r\nUnrivalled Connectivity\r\nOne of the standout features of Bellingham Manor is its strategic location. Positioned just minutes from the M1 motorway, the development offers effortless connectivity for  and commuters. Dublin is a comfortable 45-minute drive to the south, while Belfast is reached in just 70 minutes to the north. With Dundalk and Drogheda both within easy reach, residents can enjoy a serene village setting without compromising on access to Ireland’s major business and cultural hubs.\r\n\r\nLifestyle & Community\r\nCastlebellingham itself is a picturesque village steeped in history, offering a vibrant community atmosphere. Residents will find excellent schools, local shops, and essential amenities right on their doorstep. For those who love the outdoors, the surrounding Louth countryside provides stunning walking and cycling trails, with beautiful eastern coast beaches just a short drive away.\r\n\r\nBellingham Manor is more than just a new development; it is a community designed for the future. Experience the perfect balance of rural tranquility and urban convenience in one of the East Coast’s most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nRegister your interest today with DNG Duffy.\r\n\r\nNote: Potential purchasers are specifically advised to verify the floor areas as part of their due diligence. Pictures/maps/dimensions are for illustration purposes only and potential purchasers should satisfy themselves of final finish and unit/land areas. Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "• Commuter’s Dream: Immediate access to the M1; 45 mins to Dublin / 70 mins to Belfast.\r\n• Diverse Selection: High-specification 3 & 4 bedroom detached, semi-detached, and terraced homes.\r\n• A Rated Efficiency: Modern, sustainable homes built for the future.\r\n• Village Charm: A peaceful, well-established community with excellent local schools and amenities.\r\n• Exclusive development of spacious 2, 3 & 4 Bed Homes and Bungalows\r\n• A-rated energy efficient homes (A1/A2 BER) built to NZEB standards\r\n• High-efficiency air-to-water heat pump system\r\n• PV solar panels installed for lower energy costs\r\n• Luxury shaker-style kitchens with soft-close units\r\n• Stylish bathrooms and en-suites with premium sanitary ware\r\n• Elegant fitted wardrobes included in double bedrooms\r\n• High-quality Ultratec windows and external doors\r\n• Cobble-lock driveways, seeded gardens & timber fencing\r\n• Pre-wired EV charging points and high-speed broadband provision"
      },
      {
